# UI

Use tokens in `src/index.css`. Do not add CDNs, Google Fonts, analytics, remote images, or new UI kits.

- Light theme. Surfaces: `--bg`, `--bg-elevated`, `--bg-soft`, `--border`, `--shadow`
- Text: `--text` / `--muted` (keep contrast; never gray-on-gray)
- Status: `--success` `--danger` `--warn` plus a text label (never color alone)
- Font: system stack only (`--font`, `--font-mono`)
- Controls: `Button` / `Input`; visible `:focus-visible`; `cursor-pointer` on clickable elements
- Token field stays `type="password"`; never render the saved token
- English UI; dense internal-tool layout (header, tabs, tables, settings form)
